    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When navigating a dungeon, a map is always a handy tool. But what if the dungeon <strong>IS</strong> the map? In this lighthearted puzzle game, you'll fold the map in various ways to find new rooms and uncover paths to rooms that initially look inaccessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fold and unfold, find loot, and unlock doors to make your way to the chest containing (hopefully!) the legendary GaMuffin!  After all, map solving is hungry work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Map-Folding Mechanics:</strong> Alter the landscape by folding the map to solve puzzles and navigate obstacles.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Engage with a variety of puzzles that test your creativity and strategic thinking.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Visuals:</strong> Enjoy a beautifully crafted 2D world with a unique art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's make the world a little bit better:\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/1734d2fecbc2166735450949064a9185.webp?t=1754321929\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 10% of all profits will go to the Project for Awesome and the Foundation to Decrease World Suck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock walls will block your progress:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/368e4ae686c385152b616eb2946afb65.webp?t=1754321929\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other barriers can be removed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/938d5bda8fbcdbeb11fff6a9a7449bf9.avif?t=1754321929\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just need the right &quot;key&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/e0f4404115848276e140f3e6dbae48de.avif?t=1754321929\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a rock wall isn't an impossible barrier when you can control the map itself:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/eb01b6dfb2c9894a386739706308e869.poster.avif?t=1754321929\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/eb01b6dfb2c9894a386739706308e869.webm?t=1754321929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/eb01b6dfb2c9894a386739706308e869.mp4?t=1754321929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When navigating a dungeon, a map is always a handy tool. But what if the dungeon <strong>IS</strong> the map? In this lighthearted puzzle game, you'll fold the map in various ways to find new rooms and uncover paths to rooms that initially look inaccessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fold and unfold, find loot, and unlock doors to make your way to the chest containing (hopefully!) the legendary GaMuffin!  After all, map solving is hungry work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Innovative Map-Folding Mechanics:</strong> Alter the landscape by folding the map to solve puzzles and navigate obstacles.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenging Puzzles:</strong> Engage with a variety of puzzles that test your creativity and strategic thinking.\u200b</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Captivating Visuals:</strong> Enjoy a beautifully crafted 2D world with a unique art style.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Let's make the world a little bit better:\u00a0</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/1734d2fecbc2166735450949064a9185.webp?t=1754321929\" width=32 height=32 /></span>\u00a0 10% of all profits will go to the Project for Awesome and the Foundation to Decrease World Suck.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rock walls will block your progress:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/368e4ae686c385152b616eb2946afb65.webp?t=1754321929\" width=616 height=50 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Other barriers can be removed:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/938d5bda8fbcdbeb11fff6a9a7449bf9.avif?t=1754321929\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You just need the right &quot;key&quot;:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/e0f4404115848276e140f3e6dbae48de.avif?t=1754321929\" width=616 height=75 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even a rock wall isn't an impossible barrier when you can control the map itself:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/eb01b6dfb2c9894a386739706308e869.poster.avif?t=1754321929\" width=600 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/eb01b6dfb2c9894a386739706308e869.webm?t=1754321929\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3532990/extras/eb01b6dfb2c9894a386739706308e869.mp4?t=1754321929\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "The Map Is the Thing is a casual, mind-bending puzzle game. Explore a dungeon where you solve puzzles by folding your map to open new paths. Find keys to defeat barriers and find the fabled GaMuffin.",
